    C3["<b>Policy reductio</b><br/>Take the IMF's own advice — consolidate 7.5pp of GDP, cut rates, loosen the currency — run it through IMF-derived econometrics, and the current account rises about 4pp of China's GDP. The cure enlarges the disease."]
